config LIMINEFB
    bool "Limine framebuffers"
    default y
    help
      The framebuffers the bootloader set up, as fbd devices
      unless a native display driver takes their memory over

config BOCHSFB
    bool "Bochs and QEMU standard VGA"
    default y
    help
      The Bochs display of QEMU's -vga std, secondary-vga and
      bochs-display, in the mode the firmware set; it takes the
      screen over from the boot framebuffer on the same memory
